zj/thumb/8/84/2jjzg8uu3qcdzbyv9wzyzjg2yjkdg36.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%9B%B2%E7%82%B9%E7%AA%81%E8%A2%AD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/84/2jjzg8uu3qcdzbyv9wzyzjg2yjkdg36.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%9B%B2%E7%82%B9%E7%AA%81%E8%A2%AD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/84/2jjzg8uu3qcdzbyv9wzyzjg2yjkdg36.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />盲点突袭\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;消耗：</b>2\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:30%;\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;技能类别：</b>职业技能\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;冷却：</b>/\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;攻击方式：</b>远程、对单位\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程：</b>1-4十字\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;射程高低差：</b>↓5-↑5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围：</b>0\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left text-nowrap\" colspan=\"2\"><b>&#160;范围高低差：</b>↓0-↑0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<p>（物理伤害）单体攻击，造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>伤害；之后再对正前方<font color=\"#ed7950\">1*4</font>格内所有敌人造成<font color=\"#ed7950\">90%</font>范围伤害。<br />✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"附属被动\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">附属被动</font></span></span>]，效果：对拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"重点标记\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">重点标记</font></span></span>]的敌人，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>、暴击率提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>、暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>；从敌人背后攻击时，暴击率、暴击伤害提高效果翻倍。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-4十字 0.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c3/71ie2b5wsb4j572c1pjoa81i9hibyci.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-4%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_0.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c3/71ie2b5wsb4j572c1pjoa81i9hibyci.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%A7%91%E5%B0%94%E2%80%A2%E7%A0%B4%E6%99%93%E4%B9%8B%E5%BD%B1\" title=\"角色图鉴库/科尔•破晓之影\"><img alt=\"头像 科尔•破晓之影.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/37/s64mud9bi15h38c9dwqxym1is3qfo2p.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">科尔•破晓之影</font></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><